---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | PaddleFitHub"
  description="Terms and disclaimers for using PaddleFitHub's free pickleball calculators. Read before using our tools."
  canonicalPath="/terms/"
>
  <div class="bg-canvas-soft">
    <div class="container-narrow py-12 md:py-16">
      <h1 class="text-display-xl text-ink mb-4">Terms of service.</h1>
      <p class="text-caption text-mute mb-8">Last updated: July 2026</p>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-body-md text-body">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">Agreement to terms</h2>
          <p>
            By accessing and using paddlefithub.com ("the Website"), you agree to be bound by these
            Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the Website.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">Description of service</h2>
          <p>
            PaddleFitHub provides free, web-based calculator tools designed to help pickleball players
            make informed decisions about paddle equipment. Our tools include grip size calculators,
            weight advisors, shape comparisons, core thickness advisors, overgrip adjustment calculators,
            arm-friendly paddle finders, and round-robin rotation generators.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">Calculator disclaimer</h2>
          <p>
            <strong>Our calculators provide general guidance and are not a substitute for professional advice.</strong>
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            The recommendations generated by our tools are based on general formulas, industry-standard
            measurements, and commonly accepted guidelines. They are intended as starting points for your
            equipment decisions, not definitive answers.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Individual results may vary based on factors including but not limited to: playing technique,
            physical condition, specific paddle construction, environmental conditions, and personal preference.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            The arm-friendly paddle finder provides informational recommendations only and is not medical
            advice. If you are experiencing pain or injury, consult a qualified healthcare professional.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">Accuracy of information</h2>
          <p>
            While we strive to provide accurate and up-to-date information, we make no warranties or
            representations about the accuracy, completeness, or suitability of the calculator results
            or any content on this website. Formulas and assumptions used in our calculators are documented
            within each tool.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">Use of the website</h2>
          <p>You agree to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 mt-2">
            <li>Use the Website for lawful purposes only</li>
            <li>Not attempt to interfere with the proper functioning of the Website</li>
            <li>Not attempt to gain unauthorized access to any part of the Website</li>
            <li>Not reproduce, duplicate, copy, sell, or resell any part of the Website without permission</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">Intellectual property</h2>
          <p>
            All content on paddlefithub.com, including but not limited to text, calculator logic, design,
            graphics, and code, is the property of PaddleFitHub and is protected by applicable intellectual
            property laws. You may use the calculators for personal, non-commercial purposes.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">Limitation of liability</h2>
          <p>
            PaddleFitHub shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or
            special damages arising from your use of or inability to use the Website or its calculators,
            including but not limited to damages from equipment purchases made based on our recommendations
            or from physical injury related to paddle selection or play.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">External links</h2>
          <p>
            The Website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the content,
            privacy policies, or practices of any third-party websites.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">Changes to terms</h2>
          <p>
            We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Changes will be posted on this page
            with an updated date. Continued use of the Website after changes constitutes acceptance of
            the updated terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-3">Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about these terms? Contact us at
            <a href="mailto:allenquirys01@gmail.com" class="text-link hover:underline">allenquirys01@gmail.com</a>
            or visit our <a href="/contact/" class="text-link hover:underline">contact page</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
